    <item>
      <title>SQL LEFT JOIN only last record of right table — 4 種解決方案</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202201/sql-left-join-last-record/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jan 2022 11:25:06 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202201/sql-left-join-last-record/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>技術教學</category>
      <description>最近工作時剛好遇到了一個需求：「需要取得每位使用者最後的工作記錄。」使用者是一張 table，工作記錄又是ㄧ張 table；原本以為這個簡單的需求用個 leftJoin 就能瞬間搞定，結果卻搞了自己快一個晚上…因此決定把解決方案放上來，給有遇到相同問題朋友們。</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202201/sql-left-join-last-record/images/sql-left-join-last-record-og_hu_f9bc1c3078f9f5b1.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>最近工作時遇到了一個需求：「需要取得每位使用者最後的工作記錄。」使用者是一張 table，工作記錄又是ㄧ張 table；原本以為這個簡單的需求用個 leftJoin 就能瞬間搞定，結果卻搞了自己快一個晚上…因此決定把解決方案放上來，給有遇到相同問題朋友們。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202201/sql-left-join-last-record/images/sql-left-join-last-record-01.webp" width="1400" height="739" alt="SQL LEFT JOIN only last record of right table — 4 種解決方案（圖 1）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>文章大綱
一、使用線上 SQL 語法測試網站來理解＆學習這個知識
二、生成 users、user_logs 兩張 table
三、撰寫可以找出 right table「所有欄位」的 SQL
  ➤ 用 table alias name 來內部比對取得最大值
  ➤ 用 max 函式來找出最大值
四、撰寫找出 right table「最後 updated_at」的 SQL
  ➤ 用 GROUP BY 的概念搭配 MAX 函式篩選出最大值
  ➤ 用 Laravel 現成函式 subquery-joins 找出最大值
</code></pre><hr>
<h2 id="一使用線上-sql-語法測試網站來理解學習這個知識">一、使用線上 SQL 語法測試網站來理解＆學習這個知識<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%80%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e7%b7%9a%e4%b8%8a-sql-%e8%aa%9e%e6%b3%95%e6%b8%ac%e8%a9%a6%e7%b6%b2%e7%ab%99%e4%be%86%e7%90%86%e8%a7%a3%e5%ad%b8%e7%bf%92%e9%80%99%e5%80%8b%e7%9f%a5%e8%ad%98" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>考慮到讀者未必手上都剛好有能夠運行的資料庫環境，所以這邊推薦兩個實用的線上 SQL 語法測試網站(<a href="http://sqlfiddle.com/">SQL fiddle</a>、<a href="https://paiza.io/en/projects/new?language=mysql">MySQL Online</a>)</p>
<p>如果不知道如何使用，可以參考我之前的文章：「<a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/online-sql-playgrounds/">線上 SQL 語法測試網站(SQL fiddle、MySQL Online)</a>」</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="二生成-usersuser_logs-兩張-table">二、生成 users、user_logs 兩張 table<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%8c%e7%94%9f%e6%88%90-usersuser_logs-%e5%85%a9%e5%bc%b5-table" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">CREATE</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">TABLE</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>id<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>INT,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>name<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>varchar(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">50</span>)<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">CREATE</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">TABLE</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>id<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>INT,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>user_id<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>INT,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>log<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>varchar(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">50</span>),<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>updated_at<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">timestamp</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;John&#39;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;Yannis&#39;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;Victor&#39;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">4</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;Jimmy&#39;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">5</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;Richard&#39;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;John 工作記錄 1&#34;</span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;2022-01-01 00:00:00&#34;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;John 工作記錄 big&#34;</span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;2022-01-09 00:00:00&#34;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;John 工作記錄 2&#34;</span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;2022-01-05 00:00:00&#34;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INSERT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">INTO</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">VALUES</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">4</span>,<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;John 工作記錄 3&#34;</span>,<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#34;2022-01-06 00:00:00&#34;</span>);<span style="color:#6e7681">
