<h3 id="-用-laravel-現成函式-subquery-joins-找出最大值">用 Laravel 現成函式 <a href="https://laravel.com/docs/8.x/queries#subquery-joins">subquery-joins</a> 找出最大值<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e7%94%a8-laravel-%e7%8f%be%e6%88%90%e5%87%bd%e5%bc%8f-subquery-joins-%e6%89%be%e5%87%ba%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e5%80%bc" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-php" data-lang="php"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$latestLogs</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> DB<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">::</span>table(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;user_logs&#39;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>                <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>select(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;user_id&#39;</span>, DB<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">::</span>raw(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;MAX(updated_at) as last_log_created_at&#39;</span>))
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>                <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>groupBy(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;user_id&#39;</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$users</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> DB<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">::</span>table(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;users&#39;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>joinSub(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$latestLogs</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;latest_logs&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#ff7b72">function</span> (<span style="color:#79c0ff">$join</span>) {
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>            <span style="color:#79c0ff">$join</span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>on(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;users.id&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;=&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;latest_logs.user_id&#39;</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        })<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>get();
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/c3f98ae4141dd457ae25e9c2feeaf0d3" rel="noopener">last_record_method4.php</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
